Currently there's not enough information in your sample data frame (two values) to reproduce the Excel graph (four values). You probably want to do something like this:

df <- data.frame(Condition=c("Control", "Experimental"), Compliance=c("Complied", "Complied","Did Not Comply", "Did Not Comply"), value=c(0.77, 0.29, 0.23, 0.71))
ggplot(df,aes(Compliance, value, fill=Condition))+geom_bar(stat="identity", position="dodge")

Ben

