Thanks for the help, final code for matching Excel:

df <- data.frame(Condition = c("Control", "Experimental"), Complied = c("Complied", "Complied","Did Not Comply", "Did Not Comply"), Compliance = c(0.77, 0.29, 0.23, 0.71))
ggplot(data = df, aes(x = Complied, y = Compliance, fill = Condition)) + geom_bar(stat = "identity", position = "dodge") + scale_x_discrete(name = "")

