this is possibly best asked on the manipulatr google group, but:

you want the lubridate package, another fine offering from RStudio

install.packages("lubridate")
library("lubridate")

my_date <- "2015-03-07"
my_date <- ymd(my_date)

> wday(my_date)
[1] 7

> wday(my_date, label = TRUE)
[1] Sat

HTH

