Try assigning the labels to the column names as:

names(hetshoms)[1:8]<-c("chrom", "start.pos", "end.pos", "hets", "het_stat", "homs", "hom_stat", "indiv")

And then switch:

> facet_wrap(~chrom)

to

facet_grid(chrom~.)

Wayne

